    },
    "body": "The information is expected to be used for assembler and disassembler, we didn't expect OS or loader to load this, the general design for the build attribute/GNU property is:\r\n- build attribute are hold those info which only used for toolchain and that's strip-able\r\n- GNU property is hold those info may used by dynamic linker or OS\r\n\r\nOne major reason is we didn't have LOAD attribute for build attribute section, which means it's harder to access by dynamic linker or OS.\r\n\r\nHowever I think you raise a valid concern here is we should add more description/NOTE for that :)",
    "created_at": "2025-08-14T09:02:19Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-08-14T09:02:20Z",
